  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_FloaromaTownWasBarren",
      "en_US": [
        "Floaroma Town was a barren, desolate\n",
        "hill long ago, avoided even by Pokémon.\r",
        "People started planting flowers on it\n",
        "because it was such a sad place.\r",
        "But nothing would grow...\n",
        "People didn’t know what to do...\r",
        "And then one day, someone expressed\n",
        "thanks for the blessings of nature.\r",
        "Then, the whole hill burst into bloom."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_CuteHowPokemonPluckBerries",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you think it’s cute how\n",
        "Pokémon pluck Berries?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_HeresTMForPluck",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes! You agreed!\n",
        "Here’s the TM for the move Pluck!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_IJustLikeWeirdThings",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh...\n",
        "I guess I just like weird things..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_UsingPluckEatsBerry",
      "en_US": [
        "When a Pokémon uses Pluck, it eats\n",
        "a Berry held by its foe in battle.\r",
        "I like how it steals a Berry.\n",
        "It’s so cute!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaTownMiddleHouse_Text_ClefairyCry",
      "en_US": "CLEFAIRY: Rii?"
    },
